        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    autonumber\n    actor User\n    participant Client as Client App\n    participant Timer as timer:PomodoroTimer\n    participant Controller as SessionsController\n    participant Service as SessionsService\n    participant DB as PostgreSQL DB\n    participant Analytics as Analytics Service\n\n    Note over User, Analytics: Part 1: Start &amp; Complete Timer\n    User-&gt;&gt;Client: Click Start Focus Session\n    \n    create participant Timer\n    Client-&gt;&gt;Timer: &lt;&lt;create&gt;&gt; new PomodoroTimer(duration=25m)\n    \n    Timer-&gt;&gt;Timer: runCountdownLoop()\n    Timer--&gt;&gt;Client: Timer Completed Signal\n    \n    Client-&gt;&gt;Controller: POST /api/sessions [duration &gt;= 25m]\n    Controller-&gt;&gt;Service: logCompletedSession(userId, taskId, duration)\n    Service-&gt;&gt;DB: INSERT INTO focus_sessions VALUES(...)\n    DB--&gt;&gt;Service: Session Record Saved\n    \n    %% Asynchronous event push\n    Service-)Analytics: recordUserStatsAsync(userId, duration)\n    \n    Service--&gt;&gt;Controller: Return Session Summary DTO\n    Controller--&gt;&gt;Client: 201 Created\n    \n    Note over User, Analytics: Part 2: Cleanup\n    Client-&gt;&gt;Timer: destroyTimer()\n    destroy Timer\n    \n    Client--&gt;&gt;User: Play Completion Sound &amp; Show Stats Summary&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="xTBWAZkeM8iuI706MJQg-1">
